---
// Servers.astro — Temporalmente en construcción
---

<section id="servers" class="servers-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">SERVIDORES OFICIALES</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">Únete a nuestra comunidad gamer. Servidores dedicados con soporte 24/7 y contenido personalizado.</p>
    
    <div class="construction-wrapper">
      <div class="construction-card pixel-border">
        <div class="construction-icon">🚧</div>
        <h3 class="construction-title arcade-font">SECCIÓN EN CONSTRUCCIÓN</h3>
        <p class="construction-text">
          Estamos trabajando en mejoras para esta sección.<br/>
          ¡Volvé pronto para ver las novedades!
        </p>
        <div class="construction-bar">
          <div class="construction-bar-fill"></div>
        </div>
        <span class="construction-status terminal-font">STATUS: BUILDING...</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .servers-section {
    padding: 100px 0;
    border-top: 3px solid #141026;
    background-color: #07050e;
  }

  .construction-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  .construction-card {
    background-color: var(--color-panel-bg);
    border-color: #231c3c;
    padding: 60px 40px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 600px;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .construction-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: -100%;
    width: 200%;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      transparent,
      var(--neon-yellow),
      var(--neon-cyan),
      var(--neon-yellow),
      transparent
    );
    animation: border-sweep 3s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes border-sweep {
    0% { transform: translateX(-50%); }
    100% { transform: translateX(50%); }
  }

  .construction-icon {
    font-size: 4rem;
    animation: icon-pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 15px rgba(255, 200, 0, 0.4));
  }

  @keyframes icon-pulse {
    0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
    50% { transform: scale(1.15); }
  }

  .construction-title {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--neon-yellow);
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-yellow-glow);
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .construction-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 420px;
  }

  .construction-bar {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
    height: 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid #231c3c;
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .construction-bar-fill {
    height: 100%;
    width: 60%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-cyan), var(--neon-yellow));
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-cyan-glow);
    border-radius: 4px;
    animation: bar-progress 2.5s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }

  @keyframes bar-progress {
    0% { width: 30%; }
    100% { width: 75%; }
  }

  .construction-status {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--neon-cyan);
    text-shadow: 0 0 5px var(--neon-cyan-glow);
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    animation: status-blink 1.2s steps(1) infinite;
  }

  @keyframes status-blink {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.3; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 576px) {
    .construction-card {
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }
    .construction-icon {
      font-size: 3rem;
    }
    .construction-title {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
